  "findings": [
    "MP compute_chunk_hashes discards partial chunks",
    "default prefetch objects are temporary; skip_l1 removes persisted objects from L1",
    "MP FS list API iterates per file, no payload coalescing",
    "isolated_ipc config default false despite release wording; explicit true used",
    "V1 packed K/V incompatibility reported in upstream issue 4463 is a candidate cause, not independently proven"
  ]
